at churros?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_04","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_13","text":"Of course! I could eat a hundred!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_14","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_15","text":"Is it okay for him to go around talking like that?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_16","text":"I think... it'll be okay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_17","text":"As long as we don't seem too out of place...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_18","text":"Besides, nobody really questioned us back in our world, either.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_19","text":"Sounds like it hasn't been easy...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_20","text":"Y-yeah...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_21","text":"Anyway, I didn't have any money, so I looked for a job that came with room and board, but that didn't work out either.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_22","text":"Still, I'm glad I got to meet you, Commander. At least now I know what's going on.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_23","text":"Oh right, would it be okay if I contacted Leona-san? I'd like to let her know I've found a place to stay...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_24","text":"Sure, let's go visit her with Teddie sometime.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_25","text":"Okay, hehe.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_26","text":"So we're investigating the area?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_27","text":"Yeah, we need to start by gathering some information...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_28","text":"... Look over there, Monsieur.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["mysteriousgirl"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_29","text":"... Huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_30","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_30","text":"A girl stands in the middle of a park, staring blankly up at the sky.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Park","bgArt":"park","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_31","text":"I don't think that's... a Nikke.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"miranda","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_32","text":"Her arms and legs are mechanical!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"phantom","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_33","text":"Quite so. If a Nikke were in that state, a Mind Switch would be inevitable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_34","text":"Maybe she's one of the older Nikke models or something?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_35","text":"I've heard they used to look like that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_36","text":"A Mind Switch?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_37","text":"Hmm... Have you heard about us Nikkes?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_38","text":"Oh yes, Leona-san told me... she wasn't human.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_39","text":"... It's hard to believe, though.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_40","text":"You can get summoned to another world, so what could possibly surprise you anymore?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_41","text":"Anyway, the point is, we were human once.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_42","text":"So even as Nikkes, we still have to look human.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_43","text":"Otherwise... well, to put it simply, we'd end up with something like cognitive dissonance, and it'd really mess with our heads.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"quency_e","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_44","text":"We can't exactly have guns for arms, tank treads for legs, or missiles firing out of our chests, you know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_ce009_1_03_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"ce009_02","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_ce009_1_03_s_45","text":"I-I'm not really sure what it means, but I get it... I think.",